{
  "_info": "Mission Board (/missions). Amounts in cents. Types: deliver (item, amount; pays rewardPerItemCents per delivered unmodified item, 0 = price limit, always <= PriceGuard.maxNpcOrderPrice; no completion money and never crate keys, because the items can be bought from the server), stat (stats = vanilla statistics 'type:object', e.g. killed:skeleton, mined:diamond_ore, crafted:bread, custom:fish_caught; difference since accepting; mined: only counts natural blocks the player mined one by one, not Veinminer chain blocks; killed: only counts mobs the player killed, by origin – bred, summoned, spawn egg and respawned mobs (Ender Dragon after the world's first) never count, spawner mobs × spawnerKillFactor; dragon-only missions are no longer offered once the first dragon has been defeated), treasure (fishing treasures), explore (dimension/biome/structure, '#tag' allowed; each target and each structure instance pays only once per player and is not offered again). Optional per mission: icon, weight, timeLimitMinutes (0 = tier), keyTier/keys (otherwise tier; not for deliver), enabled. rotationHours must divide 24.",
